      "default": "<H2 class=\"loyaltyheader\"> Welcome to the CHOC Club</H2>\r\n\r\n<H3 class=\"loyaltyh3\"> Join our new in-store loyalty program today!</H3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What is CHOC?</strong> The easy answer: If you know you know.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>(In case you don’t know, we’ll let you in on the secret!)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CHOC is short for chocolate. More specifically, Malley’s Chocolate—Northeast Ohio’s favorite chocolate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After years of distributing CHOC bumper stickers, we wanted to take our CHOC Club to the next level. That’s why we’ve\r\n  decided to use the name for our new loyalty program. Don’t worry, our bumper stickers aren’t going anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now you can join our CHOC Club in-store loyalty program. Every purchase gets you closer to a discount on your\r\n  favorite Malley’s confections.</p>"
